<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Solidere up on higher turnover.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Solidere up on higher turnover.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares rose on higher turnover on Thursday as A shares were up to $114.75 from Wednesday's $113.625 and B shares were also up to $117.625 from $116.875.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares on the Beirut Stock Exchange (BSE) rose to 15,500 shares from Wednesday's 12,032 and value was $1,796,095.625 from $1,375,809.5.</p>
<p>Also traded on the BSE were 100 shares of piping maker Eternit at $1.8125 up from $1.75 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index rose 0.23 percent to 83.53 and the BLOM stock index rose 0.68 percent to 982.45</p>
<p>-- Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
